<title>Paragraph 1</title><p>The Holy Scripture is sufficient.<note><reference osisRef="2Tim.3.16">2 Tim. 3:16</reference></note></p>
$$$/Chapter 1. Scripture/2
<title>Paragraph 2</title><p>The whole counsel of God is written.</p>
$$$/Chapter 2. God
<title>Chapter 2</title><title>OF GOD AND THE HOLY TRINITY</title><p>The Lord our God is one God.</p>
